This project builds the `fec` command-line tool from AOSP sources for use
on Android devices (e.g. together with avbtool). It vendors the following
upstream sources:

- verity/fec (main.cpp, image.cpp, image.h)      - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/extras/+/refs/heads/main/verity/fec

- libfec (fec_open.cpp, fec_read.cpp, fec_verity.cpp, fec_process.cpp,
  avb_utils_stub.cpp, include/fec/*.h)           - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/extras/+/refs/heads/main/libfec

- libfec_rs (external/fec: encode_rs_char.c, decode_rs_char.c,
  init_rs_char.c and headers)                    - LGPL-2.1
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/fec/+/refs/heads/main

- libsparse                                     - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/refs/heads/main/libsparse

- squashfs_utils (squashfs_utils.c/.h)          - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/extras/+/refs/heads/main/squashfs_utils

- ext4_utils headers (ext4_sb.h and friends)    - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/extras/+/refs/heads/main/ext4_utils

- libbase headers (android-base/*.h)            - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/libbase/+/refs/heads/main

- libcutils headers (cutils/klog.h, cutils/fs.h)- Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/refs/heads/main/libcutils

- utils/Compat.h                                - Apache-2.0
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/refs/heads/main/include/utils

- zlib (deps/zlib)                              - zlib license
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/zlib/+/refs/heads/main

- deps/mini/*: standalone implementations of the small subset of
  libbase / libcrypto (SHA-1, SHA-256, EVP digest) / libcutils used by the
  tool. Written for this project.

The resulting binary statically links LGPL-2.1 code (libfec_rs); all
sources are provided in this repository.
